{"id":"19-518-2-5","zh":"163. 在 naṃ 前，可选地","confidence":75}
{"id":"19-519-2-10","zh":"在 naṃ 前，以 ltu 结尾的词以及 pitu 等词，可选地变为 āraṅ。","confidence":75}
{"id":"19-519-11-12","zh":"vattārānaṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"19-520-2-4","zh":"164. ā","confidence":80}
{"id":"19-521-2-10","zh":"在 naṃ 前，以 ltu 结尾的词以及 pitu 等词，可选地变为 ā。","confidence":75}
{"id":"19-521-11-13","zh":"vattānaṃ、vattūnaṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"19-521-14-18","zh":"smā 变为 ṭā：vattārā。","confidence":80}
{"id":"19-522-2-5","zh":"174. smiṃ 变为 ṭi","confidence":80}
{"id":"19-523-2-8","zh":"在替换为 āra 之后，smiṃ 变为 ṭi。","confidence":75}
{"id":"19-524-2-6","zh":"176. āra 变短为 araṅ","confidence":65}
{"id":"19-525-2-6","zh":"在 smiṃ 前，āra 变为短音。","confidence":75}
{"id":"19-525-7-12","zh":"vattari，vattāresu、vattūsu、vattusu。","confidence":90}
{"id":"19-525-13-14","zh":"同样地——","confidence":85}
{"id":"19-526-2-11","zh":"同样还有 bhattu、kattu、netu，sotu、ñātu、jetu、chettu；","confidence":85}
{"id":"19-527-2-9","zh":"bhettu、dātu、dhātu、boddhu，以及 viññāpetu 等等。","confidence":85}
{"id":"19-528-2-20","zh":"至于 satthu 一词，在 nā 前，由于“多样”这一总则的作用，依“ltu + pitādīna + mase”可选地替换为 āra，得 satthārā、satthunā。","confidence":70}
{"id":"19-528-21-23","zh":"其余与 vattu 相同。","confidence":90}
{"id":"19-529-2-6","zh":"在 si 前变为 ā：pitā。","confidence":80}
{"id":"19-529-7-18","zh":"依“ltu + pitādīna + mase”替换为 āra 之后——","confidence":75}
{"id":"19-530-2-6","zh":"177. pitu 等词（natu 等除外）","confidence":70}
{"id":"19-531-2-11","zh":"除 natu 等以外的 pitu 等词，其 āra 在一切格语尾前都变为短音。","confidence":75}
{"id":"19-531-12-47","zh":"只有在“ltu + pitādīna + mase”“su + hisvā + raṅa”“naṃmhi vā”这几条所说的格语尾在后时才有 āraṅ，所以说“一切”是就这些格语尾而言的。","confidence":65}
{"id":"19-531-48-49","zh":"pitaro。","confidence":90}
{"id":"19-531-50-55","zh":"bho pita、pitā，pitaro。","confidence":90}
{"id":"19-531-56-60","zh":"pitaraṃ，pitare、pitaro。","confidence":90}
{"id":"19-531-61-67","zh":"pitarā，pitarehi、pitarebhi、pitūhi、pitūbhi。","confidence":90}
{"id":"19-531-68-74","zh":"pitu、pituno、pitussa，pitarānaṃ、pitūnaṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"19-531-75-87","zh":"“pitunnaṃ”这一形式，据说是在 naṃ 前元音变长之后，再变短并重叠辅音而成。","confidence":55}
{"id":"19-531-88-108","zh":"依“规则连同承接下来的成分一起理解”这一原则，在“bahukatinnaṃ”这条规则中拆分出 nuk，也可以在这里承接下来的 naṃ 前得出这个形式。","confidence":45}
{"id":"19-531-109-111","zh":"第五格与第三格相同，第六格与第四格相同。","confidence":70}
{"id":"19-531-112-118","zh":"pitari，pitaresu、pītūsu，这里不变短音。","confidence":60}
{"id":"19-531-119-122","zh":"nattā，nattāro。","confidence":90}
{"id":"19-531-123-130","zh":"bho natta、nattā，nattāro 等等，与 vattu 相同。","confidence":85}
{"id":"19-532-2-4","zh":"guṇavantu + si，","confidence":80}
{"id":"19-533-2-4","zh":"151. ntu 的","confidence":75}
{"id":"19-534-2-6","zh":"在 si 前，ntu 变为 ṭā。","confidence":80}
{"id":"19-534-7-8","zh":"guṇavā。","confidence":90}
{"id":"19-534-9-23","zh":"在 yo 前，依“ntantūnaṃ nto yomhi paṭhame”，ntu 连同格语尾一起变为 nto。","confidence":75}
{"id":"19-534-24-48","zh":"这里，依“ntu 是与 vantu、mantu、avantu、tavantu 相关的”这一释则，所取的 ntu 只限于与 vantu 等相关的，不包括 jantu、tantu 等词。","confidence":65}
{"id":"19-534-49-50","zh":"guṇavanto。","confidence":90}
{"id":"19-534-51-52","zh":"在其他情况下——","confidence":75}
{"id":"19-535-2-5","zh":"91. 在 yo 等前，ntu 的","confidence":70}
{"id":"19-536-2-6","zh":"在 yo 等语尾前，ntu 变为 a。","confidence":80}
{"id":"19-536-7-15","zh":"成为 guṇavanta 之后，按 a 结尾的词有 ṭā、ṭe 等替换：guṇavantā。","confidence":70}
{"id":"19-536-16-33","zh":"依“ṭaṭāaṃ ge”有 ṭa 等替换：bho guṇava、guṇavā、guṇavaṃ，guṇavanto、guṇavantā。","confidence":75}
{"id":"19-536-34-54","zh":"依“ntassa ca ṭa vaṃ + se”，在 aṃ 与 sa 前，nta 可选地变为 ṭa：guṇavaṃ、guṇavantaṃ，guṇavante。","confidence":65}
{"id":"19-536-55-82","zh":"依“to + tā + ti + tā sa + smā + smiṃ + nāsū”有 tā 等替换：guṇavatā、guṇavantena，guṇavantehi、guṇavantebhi。","confidence":75}
{"id":"19-536-83-123","zh":"依“在依特征而得的与依明文而得的之间，只取依明文而得的，不取依特征而得的”这一原则，这里不考虑“na lakkhaṇikassa”所持的个体立场，而由于“ato”着眼的是短音 a 这一类别，所以 guṇavantena 可以由“atena”这条规则得出。","confidence":45}
{"id":"19-536-124-131","zh":"jāti（类别）就是共相，byatti（个体）就是特殊。","confidence":75}
{"id":"19-536-132-149","zh":"guṇavato、guṇavassa、guṇavantassa；依“taṃ naṃmhi”，在 naṃ 前可选地变为 taṃ：guṇavataṃ、guṇavantānaṃ。","confidence":70}
{"id":"19-536-150-154","zh":"guṇavatā、guṇavantā、guṇavantamhā、guṇavantasmā。","confidence":90}
{"id":"19-536-155-161","zh":"guṇavati、guṇavante、guṇavantamhi、guṇavantasmiṃ，guṇavantesu。","confidence":90}
{"id":"19-536-162-198","zh":"通过拆分“ntassa ca ṭa vā”这条规则，在 yo 前 ntu 也可选地替换为 ṭa，之后 yo 变为 ṭā，于是有“cakkhumā andhitā honti”（有眼的人成了盲人）、“vaggumudātīriyā bhikkhu vaṇṇavā”（婆求河岸的比丘们容光焕发）等用例。","confidence":55}
{"id":"19-537-2-15","zh":"同样还有 gaṇavā、kulavā、phalavā、yasavā、dhanavā、sutavā、bhagavā、himavā、balavā、sīlavā、paññavā 等等。","confidence":90}
{"id":"19-538-2-6","zh":"153. himavantu 的 ntu 可选地变为 o","confidence":70}
{"id":"19-539-2-11","zh":"himavantu 在 si 前，ntu 可选地变为 o：himavanto、himavā。","confidence":75}
{"id":"19-539-12-14","zh":"其余与前面的相同。","confidence":85}
{"id":"19-540-2-13","zh":"āyasmantu 一词，在羯磨文中，有时由于“多样”这一总则的作用，可以见到指两个人时用 āyasmantā、指三个人时用 āyasmanto。","confidence":65}
{"id":"19-541-2-31","zh":"同样还有 satimā、dhitimā、gatimā、mutimā、matimā、jutimā、sirimā、hirimā、thutimā、ratimā、yatimā、sucimā、kalimā、balimā、kasimā、rucimā、buddhimā、cakkhumā、bandhumā、hetumā、setumā、ketumā、rāhumā、bhāṇumā、khāṇumā、vijjumā 等等。","confidence":90}
{"id":"19-542-2-3","zh":"以上是 u 结尾的词。","confidence":60}
{"id":"19-543-2-4","zh":"vessabhū：si 脱落。","confidence":80}
{"id":"19-543-5-9","zh":"它们的差别只在于不变短音。","confidence":60}
{"id":"19-543-10-48","zh":"依“ekavacanayosva + ghonaṃ”变为短音，再依“lā yonaṃ vo pume”变为 vo：vessabhuvo；由于说过“vevosu lussā”，所以不作 ṭa 替换；依“lopo”，yo 脱落：vessabhū。","confidence":60}
{"id":"19-543-49-64","zh":"依“ge vā”可选地变为短音：bho vessabhu、vessabhū，vessabhuvo、vessabhū。","confidence":75}
{"id":"19-543-65-69","zh":"vessabhuṃ，vessabhuvo、vessabhū。","confidence":90}
{"id":"19-543-70-73","zh":"vessabhunā 等等，与 bhikkhu 相同。","confidence":85}
{"id":"19-543-74-78","zh":"同样还有 sayambhū、parābhibhū、abhibhū 等。","confidence":90}
{"id":"19-543-79-100","zh":"至于 gotrabhū 和 sahabhū 两词，依“jantvādito no vā”，yo 可选地变为 no，或变为 vo：gotrabhuno、gotrabhuvo、gotrabhū。","confidence":70}
{"id":"19-543-101-107","zh":"sahabhuno、sahabhuvo、sahabhū，其余与 vessabhū 相同。","confidence":85}
{"id":"19-544-2-4","zh":"85. 在 kū 之后","confidence":70}
{"id":"19-545-2-8","zh":"在以 kū 词缀结尾的阳性词之后，yo 可选地变为 no。","confidence":75}
{"id":"19-545-9-10","zh":"sabbaññuno。","confidence":90}
{"id":"19-545-11-32","zh":"在其他情况下，不依“lā yonaṃ vo pume”变为 vo，因为“kūto”这条规则是与 jantu 等分开另立的。","confidence":60}
{"id":"19-545-33-35","zh":"yo 脱落时：sabbaññū。","confidence":85}
{"id":"19-545-36-43","zh":"bho sabbaññu、sabbaññū，sabbaññuno、sabbaññū 等等。","confidence":90}
{"id":"19-546-2-14","zh":"同样还有 maggaññū、dhammaññū、atthaññū、kālaññū、rattaññū、mattaññū、kataññū、kathaññū、viññū、vidū 等等。","confidence":90}
{"id":"19-546-15-43","zh":"这里，由于“vidā kū”“vito ñāto”“kammā”这三条规则所取的是 kū 词缀，所以以 rū 词缀结尾的 vedagū 等词不包括在内。","confidence":65}
{"id":"19-547-2-3","zh":"以上是 ū 结尾的词。","confidence":60}
{"id":"19-548-2-7","zh":"go + si，si 脱落。","confidence":80}
{"id":"19-548-8-9","zh":"go。","confidence":90}
